      "t": "Starving in his hospital bed, Chef Barinov calls Lyova and begs him to bring some real food from the kitchen, only for Vika to grab the phone and remind him of the doctor's strict diet. When Fedya also hangs up on him, the Chef declares that everyone has betrayed him.",
